      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"It's unbelievable.\" \u2013Donald Trump discussing the 22-foot statue of himself, newly installed at his golf club in Doral, Florida.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055456849357373921",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-16T01:14:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Dan Pfeiffer on how Democrats talk about Trump\u2019s corruption.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055437850213019701",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T23:59:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Democrats have to take a maximal approach in order to combat Republican gerrymandering efforts.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055414866664472935",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T22:27:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump admits he's for he/him, not you.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055400752508481719",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T21:31:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Kash Patel's comments on drinking aren't doing him any favors right now.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055308757228278130",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T15:26:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\u201cIf you\u2019re going to run for president, you need to know exactly what you believe.\u201d \u2013Jon Favreau\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055272257866400062",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T13:01:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump says \"you\u2019re a stupid person\" if you oppose his war with Iran.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055086138319127029",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-15T00:41:31+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The President admits he does not think about \"Americans\u2019 financial situation.\"\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2055026362360991978",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-14T20:43:59+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Jon Lovett on the Washington Post's editorial attacking Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez's criticisms of billionaires.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054620247286571232",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-13T17:50:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Jon, Tommy, and Lovett react to a plan to retire the entire Virginia Supreme Court to reinstate the state's congressional maps.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054393719130886236",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-13T02:50:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Is Tim Cook a Donald Trump fan?\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054374446756933734",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-13T01:33:31+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump floats making Venezuela the 51st state.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054324668601962888",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T22:15:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Crooked Con presale is happening NOW, exclusively for Friends of the Pod subscribers.\n\nP.S. It's not too late to subscribe if you want in on this deal. Go to crooked.com/friends and join in!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054312716257382602",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T21:28:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump is like a drunk guy at the bar who decided to pick a fight with the crazy guy with cauliflower ear.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054292540057063637",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T20:08:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If Democrats can't win by enough to retake the House, despite the setback in Virginia, then there are bigger problems.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054272152698822858",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T18:47:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump\u2019s D.C. projects are a good mix of shady influence and good, old-fashion corruption.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054215655138762840",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T15:02:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"Iran cannot have a nuclear weapon,\" is a goal. Not a plan.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2054177480274002237",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-12T12:30:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"We cannot afford to give in to those who are trying to weaponize despair.\" \u2013Senator Raphael Warnock.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2053960303398850817",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-11T22:07:51+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Senator Raphael Warnock hypothesizes what Martin Luther King Jr. would say about this moment\u2019s rising political violence.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2053854208432972270",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-11T15:06:16+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "pod-save-america",
      "voiceName": "Pod Save America",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\"JD Vance is one of the most craven politicians on the American landscape.\" \u2013Senator Warnock on the Vice President\u2019s criticism of the Pope.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/PodSaveAmerica/status/2053623100818825220",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-10T23:47:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    }
